{"title":"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An athlete's target heart rate, in beats per minute, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb7e03ccc8985ba9d029ea4add6e3e15ab9a953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the theoretical maximum heart rate. The maximum heart rate is found by subtracting the athlete's age, in years, from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/6/2c6f941fab390e81243e1cd2b40c6178f03ab3f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$220$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />. To the nearest whole number, what is the target heart rate of an athlete who is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda00d9a38a0c6bd9aac2512c6d065581882d43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> years old?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/6/4b65fa7486b4980931de48d2ae617c843cf45119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 134\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 155\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 176\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 194\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 243$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The maximum heart rate is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/f/f4f53a9896c61e762a66c8de6ca9eb9cb2cbc9c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$220-26=194$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"119\" height=\"13\" /> beats per minute. The target heart rate is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/f/3efb97a985a65a88c04a73fd3fc213d3da3ea551.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8*194 \\approx \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 155}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"165\" height=\"28\" /> beats per minute.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8\" title=\"2004 AMC 8\">2004 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2004\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problem